+All connector HTTP operations use the installed runtime's `lib/http.mjs` transport. It keeps request
+construction and protocol parsing separate from retry policy, refuses redirects, enforces a 15-second
+timeout, retries only transient server or rate-limit failures, and bounds both `Retry-After` and
+exponential backoff delays.
